/a2run
/go.work
/go.work.sum
*.o
*.bin
*.lbl
/runs/
# internal/asmbuild's cross-process build lock (see withBuildLock).
.asmbuild.lock
*.dsk
*.img

# The hand-drawn DazzleDraw board art is a SOURCE asset, not a build
# product. The blanket *.bin rule above hid it from git entirely: it
# lived only in one working tree, was never committed, and the UI design
# was written without it (which is how the shipped board ended up as FEN
# letters). Keep it tracked.
!assets/*.bin

# Generated blobs that SHIP. They are embedded by Go (//go:embed) and are
# build inputs for the disk image, so they must be TRACKED despite the
# blanket *.bin rule above -- the same reasoning as the artwork asset.
# The book is TWO pieces: the entries (resident in aux) and the name table
# (resident in Language Card bank 2). See package book's doc.
!internal/book/bookblob.bin
!internal/book/booknames.bin
!internal/book/bigbook.bin
!internal/rwts/rwtsblob.bin
!internal/tiles/tileblob.bin

# stray binaries from `go build ./cmd/...` in the repo root
/genbook
/sargon
/sprt
/genopenings
/sargon-xboard
/pullart
asm/*.map
